Subject: marc_root evaluates match=: boot2 places, the core selects

Contract C4-4 version 3 section 4 (S4-10's other half).  boot2 now
places every root-class record and selects none, so the root pass reads
each record's match= keys from the manifest copy and checks them with
marc_post's platform matcher (zorro:MMMM:PP against the board list,
mobo: and always always).  An entry none of whose keys names a board
here is skipped silently, as an ENXIO from its _load would be.  The
state harness adds an entry whose record names an absent board.

--- a/dlm_post.c
+++ b/dlm_post.c
@@ -198,14 +198,16 @@
